abstract: >-
  beal-conjecture v30 port of foundations
  v0.30-mcom-structural-verification at 2b60ccd (Lean from bc7e93b).
  Honest slice Level26/HonestB0Search/ structurally verifies four v29 finals:
  Tate displayed N_E=928=2^5*29, Mazur cusp Finset card=2,
  Ribet matching Finset card=0, Kolyvagin |Sel2|=1, 3*7=21,
  L/Ω=1/3 and 1/7, ¬IsRankZero, parent names as theorems.
  Parent Tate algorithm / Néron, {2 cusps}=X0(13)(Q),
  Sage new_subspace dim=0, and MW_rank_zero_fintype stay
  def Prop on parent files. Vendor unchanged
  db7a556/fea0c393, no nested Level26, path-requires.
  Matveev C1=143186215390 B0=10^6. Concept DOI
  10.5281/zenodo.22379293. Prior v28 version DOI
  10.5281/zenodo.22851334 at bd1400e / b780c9c. Prior v27
  version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22842767 at 4b4d6f8 / 6ccafbf.
  Prior v26 version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22832505 at 5e2906b
  / 5806dad. Prior software version v11.0.0
  (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22281075).
